      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "q1": "Do I need to pay to start?",
      "a1": "No. The free plan includes 50 trades per month, voice journaling, and AI analysis. You can stay on free forever.",
      "q2": "Which brokers can I connect?",
      "a2": "XTB (CSV), Trading 212 (API), Interactive Brokers (Flex), Binance (API), Alpaca (API), cTrader (OAuth), eToro (CSV), MT4/MT5 (HTML/Desktop Bridge), and more.",
      "q3": "How does voice journaling work?",
      "a3": "Press record, speak for 1-3 minutes about your trade. AI transcribes automatically and extracts: setup used, emotions felt, mistakes made, lessons learned.",
